- op: discuss  # 23df
  at: '2026-10-18T00:10:18Z'  # 23df
  by: agent  # 23df
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 23df
  clock: 3  # 23df
  nonce: 23df  # 23df
  message: "Satisfied in PR #1702 (dev ac651f01d5). cobol.py: the caller is the paragraph OR section whose header last preceded the statement, by the header's position (section_header now updates it); a PERFORM/CALL target binds inside the performing program (the headers of that procedure_division), then this file, then the registry. Behavioral evidence: test_cobol.py::TestCobolCallerAndTargetByPosition — b.cbl's PERFORM INIT-PARA binds b.cbl's INIT-PARA (was a.cbl's, re-observed before the fix); a PERFORM inside WORK-SEC SECTION is credited to the WORK-SEC section symbol (was MAIN-PARA); two programs in one file each bind their own INIT-PARA."  # 23df
